abstract: >
  Equal Commute Finder identifies neighborhoods where driving commute time
  to two different workplaces is approximately equal, helping households
  with two earners pick where to live. It samples a regular grid over a
  city, queries OpenRouteService for travel times to both destinations,
  extracts the equal-commute boundary plus a tolerance band, and renders
  an interactive Leaflet map with overlays for OpenStreetMap points of
  interest (kindergartens, schools, restaurants, cafes, supermarkets) and
  per-mode (drive, bike, walk) travel times to user-pinned addresses.
